Bias and Unfairness in Machine Learning Models: A Systematic Review on Datasets, Tools, Fairness Metrics, and Identification and Mitigation Methods
Tiago P. Pagano 1 , Rafael B. Loureiro 1 , Fernanda V. N. Lisboa 2 , Rodrigo M. Peixoto 3 , Guilherme A. S. Guimarães 3 , Gustavo O. R. Cruz 3 , Maira M. Araujo 2 , Lucas L. Santos 1 , Marco A. S. Cruz 4 , Ewerton L. S. Oliveira 4 , Ingrid Winkler 5 and Erick G. S. Nascimento 1,6,*
